{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223040","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1422304001:1":{"text":"你好呀，请问——","source_cn":"你好呀，请问——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F55FF70DCE060C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422304002:1":{"text":"呀，小仓鼠！毛绒绒的有两只呢……真可爱！和我的小羊一样可爱！","source_cn":"呀，小仓鼠！毛绒绒的有两只呢……真可爱！和我的小羊一样可爱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E92EB2C95FDDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422304003:1":{"text":"你们就是来村里访问的魔法师吗？","source_cn":"你们就是来村里访问的魔法师吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25D0BE9530CA51AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你们就是来村里访问的魔法师吗？","female":"你们就是来村里访问的魔法师吗？","variant_male_record_index":"165214","variant_female_record_index":"165215","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422304004:1":{"text":"呃……谢谢……我们的主人是魔法师，我们俩是魔法使魔……请不要摸我的耳朵……","source_cn":"呃……谢谢……我们的主人是魔法师，我们俩是魔法使魔……...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD1B096DD1A1EB65","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"呃……谢谢……我们的主人是魔法师，我们俩是魔法使魔……请不要摸我的耳朵……","female":"呃……谢谢……我们的主人是魔法师，我们俩是魔法使魔……请不要摸我的耳朵……","variant_male_record_index":"165216","variant_female_record_index":"165217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422304005:1":{"text":"也别捏满满的脸颊肉！我们想问，你知道弗瑞达家在哪吗？","source_cn":"也别捏满满的脸颊肉！我们想问，你知道弗瑞达家在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27AB19B2DDB1BB